    {
      "run": 1,
      "steps": 4,
      "narrative": "I've been exploring the cramped and cluttered spaces of a ship. My journey started in the galley, where I found a kettle and a dented tin. The galley itself was a mess, with salt covering every surface, but it was through this narrow space that I found my way north to the store. Here, I've discovered a few useful items, including a coil of rope, which I've picked up for potential use later.\n\nThe store itself is a dimly lit room, smelling of paraffin, and I can see a workshop and a staircase leading up to the east. The galley lies south, beckoning me back to investigate further. I've been taking stock of my surroundings, trying to make sense of this labyrinthine ship, and I'm not yet sure what dangers or opportunities lie ahead.",
